            optimize_b incl. 38,347,572 -> 30,070,710  (-21.6%)
            C svt_av1_optimize_b 30,333,183 — port now 0.991x C
            (was 1.264x)
  256 p6:   port total 131,632,427 -> 128,547,932  (-3,084,495, -2.34%)
            optimize_b incl. 16,037,990 -> 13,006,621  (-18.9%)
            C svt_av1_optimize_b 13,249,549 — port now 0.982x C
            (was 1.210x)

Both baseline callgrind runs used the pre-change `perf_encode` built from
the same commit's @- parent (perf_encode.old); all four instrumented
outputs byte-identical (port==C and pre==post on both cells).

wall clock, `tools/perf_ab.sh` (interleaved paired, 7 rounds, i265,
AB_SIZES="256 1024" AB_PRESETS="6 10"; speedup = base/cand):

  256  p6   1.017   256  p10  1.010
  1024 p6   1.032   1024 p10  1.041  (p25/p75 0.868/1.0018)

All four cells ident=Y.

